      "id": "tcp-m2-tbs2-ex2",
      "title": "Buyer basis facts",
      "html": "<p>For a separate stated Section 743(b) computation, the buyer’s outside basis is $180,000 and allocable common inside basis is $140,000. Assume an applicable election and no other adjustments.</p>"
