  "explanation": "<h3>Seller amount realized</h3><p>$150,000 cash + $30,000 liability relief.</p><h3>Seller total gain</h3><p>$180,000 − $100,000 = $80,000.</p><h3>Gain remaining after the supplied ordinary portion</h3><p>$80,000 − $20,000 = $60,000.</p><h3>Supplied transferee-specific basis adjustment</h3><p>$180,000 outside basis − $140,000 allocable inside basis = $40,000.</p>"
